{% comment %}
  [カスタマイズ] 特集ページセクション（sections/gift-feature.liquid）のブロック見出し

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} 見出し（heading・heading_size・subheading）を持つブロック

  Usage:
  {% render 'gift-feature-heading', block: block %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
  <div class="gift-feature__heading">
    {%- if block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
      <p class="gift-feature__subheading caption-with-letter-spacing">{{ block.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <h2 class="{{ block.settings.heading_size | default: 'h2' }}">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
